# The build context is the wheel, the patch series and the entry point, and nothing else: no history, no runs, no
# local environment, no secrets that happen to sit in the working tree.
*
!dist/decisio-*.whl
!patches/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/pin_installed.py
!docker/check_requirements.py
!docker/constraints.txt
